TITLE Albite kinetic dissolution with H2S gas at fixed pressure
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH   2 charge
    pe   4
    units mmol/kgw
    Fe(+3) 4
    Fe(+2) 4
    water 1

GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 5
    H2S(g) 1.0

KINETICS 1
    Albite
        -m0 1.0
        -m  1.0
        -parms 1.0 10
    -steps 10 in 100

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.csv
    -reset false
    -time true
    -step true
    -totals Ba
END
